id: pm-vcs-testenv
title: Isolate test children and provenance from ambient agent sessions
description: "Test environments must select explicit operational keys and deliberate fixture overrides. Remove ambient Claude Code, Codex, AI_AGENT and PM_AGENT session state before SDK imports; preserve parent coverage while disabling child coverage. Audit every test subprocess and add contaminated-session regression plus structural guards."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-26T06:40:36.026Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T07:09:44.964Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: The three reported annotation/bisect cases produce the same results under clean and contaminated sessions; all child launch sites use explicit environments without host spreads; exact npm/Bun release gates pass.
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T06:40:40.032Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced all three reported failures before changes by injecting synthetic CLAUDECODE, CLAUDE_CODE_*, CODEX_*, AI_AGENT and PM_AGENT_* values: 0/3 pass, actual harness claude-code versus expected codex. Keep exact provenance assertions. Introduce a pure child-environment allowlist plus an entrypoint normalizer before SDK imports; permit deliberate fixture overrides and preserve parent V8 instrumentation separately. Audit direct, aliased and namespaced child-process launches, including previously implicit environments; do not copy host process.env. Run the same three real cases in clean and contaminated children and guard future launches structurally."
  "2026-10-26T07:08:44.975Z",codex-agent,"Round-5 hermeticity: 96 test entrypoints install an operational-key allowlist before SDK imports; 136 child launch sites now carry explicit environments, including 56 previously implicit launches. Fixture identity remains explicit. Parent V8 instrumentation and runner context survive; children disable coverage and omit runner context. Node 22 contaminated-session regression 4/4 and copied-checkout/PM-context cases 2/2 pass. Three actual provenance cases pass 3/3 in clean and contaminated runs. Isolated revert proof: restoring only host-copy behavior in testEnvironment fails 0/3 with claude-code instead of codex; restoring the allowlist passes 3/3. Disabling only isolateTestSession fails its contamination/coverage regression 0/1; restoring passes 1/1. Source/test typecheck, strict lint, 86-source docstrings and zero duplication pass. No dependency changes. Full npm/Bun evidence will come from exact-head CI."
